3. Verilog testbench structure (iverilog). Top: module tb; instantiates DUT, declares wires/regs for connectivity Stimulus: initial blocks and tasks drive inputs over simulation time Observation: $display, $monitor, and VCD for passive debug Closure: $finish after pass/fail counts or explicit timeout Refer to the diagram on the right.

